<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia foreign debt data release now June 4.</title>
<headline>Australia foreign debt data release now June 4.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Bureau of Statistics (ABS) said on Monday the issue of data containing Australia's foreign debt in the March quarter has been changed to Wednesday, June 4.</p>
<p>The International Investment Position data was originally scheduled for release on Tuesday, June 3.</p>
<p>In its statement, the bureau gave no reason for the change.</p>
<p>Release time is 0130 GMT (11.30 a.m.)</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
